Security model

Prontagenda remains responsible for:

authentication;
authorization;
business rules;
validation;
database access;
multi-company isolation;
schedule consistency;
human escalation.

The agent is responsible for:

understanding natural-language requests;
determining the next workflow step;
selecting the appropriate tool;
generating conversational responses.

This separation prevents the language model from having unrestricted access to application data.

