Agent flow

A typical scheduling request follows this sequence:

WhatsApp message
      ↓
Prontagenda PHP
      ↓
Signed request to Cloud Run
      ↓
Google ADK Agent
      ↓
Gemini reasoning
      ↓
Secure tool selection
      ↓
Prontagenda tool call
      ↓
Schedule validation
      ↓
MySQL update
      ↓
Response to patient

If the workflow cannot safely continue:

Agent / tool failure
        ↓
Human intervention required
        ↓
Support queue
Example workflow
Patient

I would like to schedule an appointment.

Agent

The agent asks which professional the patient would like to see.

Patient

Dr. Monica.

Agent

The agent checks the professional's working hours and real schedule availability.

Patient

I prefer something after 5 PM.

Agent

The agent returns valid available times.

Patient

Tuesday works.

The agent verifies the selected slot, confirms the patient identity, requests any missing information, asks for final confirmation, and creates the appointment.

The appointment then appears in the real Prontagenda schedule.

